 ## [Unreleased]
+### Fixed
+- False positive when detecting missing spaces in Jinja variables when the Jinja statement is nested in literal braces ([#272](https://github.com/warpnet/salt-lint/pull/272)).
 
 ## [0.7.0] (2021-11-01)
 ### Added
